  (text "J2 WHITE" (at 14 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "F1\n500mA-1A\npolyfuse" (at 33 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "D1\nP6KE18CA\nTVS bidir" (at 53 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "C1 C2\nLDO in" (at 69 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "U2\nAMS1117-3.3\n(or MCP1700)\nSOT-223 -> +3V3" (at 76 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "U4\nMCP1700-5002\nSOT-23 -> +5V\nanalog rail" (at 101 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "+5V RAIL (U4):\nFeeds the GD2 brake-buffer op-amp only. NOTE: the GD1 anti-brake\ncurrent-source op-amp is NOT on this rail - it is powered from WHITE (~16V)\nbecause it senses in the WHITE leg at ~16V common mode (a 5V op-amp cannot).\n~11V drop from WHITE at mA-level load = negligible heat in SOT-23." (at 15 60 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "+3V3 RAIL (U2):\n  16.0V rail: P = (16.0-3.3) x 0.035 = 0.44W, dT ~27C in SOT-223.\nAMS1117 handles the thermal at 16V in but has ~5mA quiescent;\nMCP1700 is 2uA Iq but higher Rth in SOT-23 — pick per standby\nbudget vs package thermal (see design doc 7A.6)." (at 15 85 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "IDEAL-DIODE SUPPLY:\nThe reverse-switch sense amp U5 (INA210) and comparator\nU6 (LM311) run off the +5V LDO rail. The Q5/Q6 common-source\ngates need a high-side gate driver / charge pump fed from\nWHITE (open item). No self-protection (I2t/SCP). See reverse_switch sheet." (at 15 108 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "TVS selection:\nP6KE18CA bidirectional (CA suffix) ESSENTIAL — clamps both\npolarities of inductive transient on the WHITE rail." (at 80 85 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "USB POWER PATH:\nVBUS -> F_USB (500mA polyfuse) -> D_USB (BAT54) -> LDO input node.\nD_USB anode=VBUS, cathode=LDO_in. Reversed = HOST DAMAGE.\nR_CC1/R_CC2 5.1k CC pull-downs; C_USB1 10uF VBUS bulk." (at 15 130 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
)
